    ".RFN",
    "RoboForm Safenote File",
    "4.0",
    "Safenote file created by RoboForm, a program used for securely storing personal information; contains a secret text fragment, such as an ATM password or a lock key combination; used to safely save and review sensitive personal information. Unlike.RFP password files, RFN files are not used to automatically fill online forms. They are only used as a way to store sensitive text-based data. Windows Siber Systems RoboFormFree.",
    "Windows Siber Systems RoboForm.",
