    "Orbit Downloader Incomplete Download",
    "3.8",
    "File partially downloaded with Orbit Downloader, a download manager designed for Web 2.0 content; saved temporarily during the download process and is converted to the actual file when the download is complete. OB! files allow interrupted downloads to be resumed at the point where the transfer was interrupted. Windows Orbit DownloaderFree.",
