    "Multimedia ToolBook System Book",
    "3.5",
    "Backup of a SWiSH Project (.SWI) file, a custom Flash animation format; created automatically by the SWiSH authoring program in case the original project file is lost or corrupted. NOTE: You may need to rename the file extension from .sbk to .swi in order for the SBK file to open correctly. Windows SWiSHzone.com SWiSH Max. Utility file included with Multimedia ToolBook; includes scripts that extend the functionality of the ToolBook program; may add extra menu items or authoring capabilities. SBK files installed with ToolBook include PRINTWND.SBK, the MTB30.SBK and TOOLS30.SBK startup files, and the TRY.SBK tutorial file. Windows Asymetrix Multimedia Toolbook. Collection of sound samples saved in the SoundFont format; recognized by E-MU hardware, SoundBlaster sound cards, and other software samplers. The SBK format was replaced by the.SF2 file format in SoundFont 2. Windows E-MU Systems SoundFont FMJ-Software Awave Studio. Scrapbook created with Scrapbook Factory Deluxe; includes photos saved in a scrapbook format using templates and photorealistic graphics included with the software. Windows Nova Development Scrapbook Factory Deluxe —  (Discontinued).",
