    ".BST",
    "BibTeX Style Document",
    "3.4",
    "Specifies the formatting of a BibTeX (.BIB) document; referenced by the LaTeX document and used by the BibTeX program bibtex when generating items for the bibliography; may also be used to create HTML output from a BibTeX file. Custom BST files can be created using the latex makebst command. Windows TeXworks. TeXnicCenter. proTeXt. LaTeXEditor Mac TeXworks. LyX/Mac. Linux TeXworks. LaTeX teTeX.",
