    ".BOOTSKIN",
    "Stardock Bootskin File",
    "3.3",
    "Raster image used for the Windows boot screen; displayed when the computer starts up; can be viewed and modified using Stardocks BootSkin program. BootScreenView can be used to convert BOOTSKIN files to.TBS files. Windows Stardock BootSkin Snow Lands BootScreenView.",
