    "Mail Index File",
    "3.0",
    "Stores indexing data that the Mac OS X Mail program uses to make searching faster; usually named mbox.SKindex and has a related file named mbox.SKindex.isValid in the same directory. Mac Apple Mail Included with OS.",
    "Mac Apple Mail Included with OS.",
