    "Renamed NDS File",
    "2.7",
    "Nintendo DS game ROM in which the file extension has been renamed from .nds to .nd5; contains a copy of a Nintendo DS game that be played on a PC using a Nintendo DS emulator. NOTE: In order to open an ND5 file, the extension may first need to be changed back to.NDS. Windows NO$GBA. DeSmuME. iDeaS Emulator. DSemu. Dualis. Mac DeSmuME. Linux DeSmuME. iDeaS EmulatorFree.",
    "Windows NO$GBA. DeSmuME. iDeaS Emulator. DSemu. Dualis. Mac DeSmuME. Linux DeSmuME. iDeaS Emulator.",
