    ".HPS",
    "HP Digital Sender Metadata File",
    "1.2",
    "Game script used by HPL, a Frictional Games game engine that is used for first-person horror games such as Amnesia: The Dark Descent and Penumbra: Black Plague; saved in a plain text format and contains functions that define events that occur in a game map, such as doors slamming, scream sounds, or other horror events. NOTE: HPS files can be edited by users to create custom storylines for HPL and HPL2 games. Windows HPL Editor Suite. Frictional Games Amnesia: The Dark Descent. Frictional Games Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs. Frictional Games Penumbra: Black Plague. Apjjms Amnesia Lang Editor Tool. Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Other text editor Mac HPL Editor Suite. Frictional Games Amnesia: The Dark Descent. Frictional Games Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs. Frictional Games Penumbra: Black Plague. Linux HPL Editor Suite. Frictional Games Amnesia: The Dark Descent. Frictional Games Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs. Frictional Games Penumbra: Black Plague. Audio file saved in the Adaptive Differential Pulse Code Modulation (ADPCM) compression format; used by Nintendo GameCube games, such as Fifa World Cup and Lost Kingdoms; may save a sound effect or background music that is looped during gameplay. NOTE: HPS files can be opened on a PC using Winamp with the vgmstream plugin. Windows Nullsoft Winamp with the vgmstream pluginFree. File created by HP Digital Senders, which are used for scanning and sending documents; stores information entered by the user on the digital sender device LCD panel; may include a title, the scanner name, the number of pages, and other information. HPS files can be read by HP Digital Sender Administrator Software, which is provided with HP Digital Sender purchases. NOTE: HP Digital Sender Administrator Software is discontinued and no longer available. Windows HP Digital Sender Administrator Software.",
    "Windows HPL Editor Suite. Frictional Games Amnesia: The Dark Descent. Frictional Games Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs. Frictional Games Penumbra: Black Plague. Apjjms Amnesia Lang Editor Tool. Microsoft Notepad Included with OS. Other text editor. Mac HPL Editor Suite. Frictional Games Amnesia: The Dark Descent. Frictional Games Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs. Frictional Games Penumbra: Black Plague. Linux HPL Editor Suite. Frictional Games Amnesia: The Dark Descent. Frictional Games Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs. Frictional Games Penumbra: Black Plague. Windows Nullsoft Winamp with the vgmstream plugin. Windows HP Digital Sender Administrator Software.",
