    "Painter Pattern Library",
    "1.0",
    "Patterns library created by Corel Painter, a drawing application used to create digital artwork; contains one or more patterns that can be added to the Painter canvas; may include Piano Keys, Floral Fabric, and Lace Ribbon patterns. You can apply a pattern to your canvas. They are similar to other Painter media such as Weaves, Looks, and Gradients. NOTE: The.PATTERNLIBRARY file is more commonly used by Corel Painter than the PATTERNS file. Windows Corel Painter 2022. Mac Corel Painter 2022.",
