    "Coolect Album File",
    "1.0",
    "Album of media files organized by Coolect, an all-in-one solution for collecting, organizing, storing and displaying digital media files; can also be used to make a backup of a digital media collection. The Coolect program and the free Album Player is available from Coolect. Windows Coolect.",
